  message: "Re-surfaced in dogfooding tranche 10 (U06, F189.A1, severity 3). The naming_convention class->method containment attaches methods to the wrong same-name SIBLING class — 30 false out-of-span contains edges at confidence 1.0 (the same 30 provably-false class->method containments this item records, e.g. _FakeMetadata). Fix: replace the name-prefix containment heuristic with span/AST nesting under name collision (containment.py)."  # 1783
