- op: discuss  # 1b05
  at: '2026-07-12T23:24:08Z'  # 1b05
  by: agent  # 1b05
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 1b05
  clock: 9  # 1b05
  nonce: 1b05  # 1b05
  message: "Confidence face FIXED in PR #608 (ADR-0039 ruling 1). Root cause: containment Phase-1 hardcoded confidence=1.0 on naming_convention 'contains' edges — above the 0.95 linker ceiling and outranking the structurally-certain span_overlap (0.90), so a consumer trusting confidence treated the error-prone name heuristic as gold. Fix: seeded naming_convention=0.85 in the evidence registry (below span_overlap, in-band) + dropped the containment literal so Phase-1 DERIVES it (confidence_source=evidence_derived). Behavioral evidence (self-analysis, 134,017 edges; hypergumbo run . then bucket 'contains' by confidence/evidence_type): naming_convention 21,787 @ 0.85 evidence_derived; span_overlap 14,271 @ 0.90 now OUTRANKS them -> inversion resolved; canonical_name 7 @ 0.95. The 30 provably-false out-of-span containments (the false-EDGE face) were already eliminated 2026-07-11 by span-disambiguation; this closes the remaining confidence face. Tagged awaits_bakeoff_validation (confidence shifted on 16.6% of edges)."  # 1b05
